#38200
The Shou-Lin's Guild of Samsera~
The Shou lins Guild is found in the north-west quarter of Samsera.
Features include the following:
The Guild is split up into three sections: Balance (for all)
the Order of Mortis (evil) and the Order of the Lotus (good)

Storage Room
Multiple Meditation (regen) rooms
2 boards, a general and Challenge board.
shopkeep
training rooms
the Grandmaster of Balance challenge setup.
The guild is meant to reflect the shou lins simple and non
materialistic type of lifestyle.

Kurse, Sept 00
~
