#38201
The Antechamber~
   You step through the door of the monestary and enter a plain room, devoid of
any furnishings or adornments, save for the mandala on the far wall.  This
mandala depicts the four-armed Bhutadamara, the Turmoil of the Spirits.  His
central hands offer the gesture of tailokyavijaya, the "conquest of the three
worlds," making this monestary a sanctuary for all orders of monks.    
~
