#38202
The Meeting Room~
   Three sets of straw mats lay on the wooden floor of this room, where members
of the order may kneel to meet and discuss the affairs of the Shou-Lin Guild.
All differences are set aside in this room, for all care about the preservation
of the Guild's teachings and way of life.    
~
