The Hall of Balance~
   This long wooden corridor stretches east west through the heart of the
temple and is occupied by shou-lin from all orders.  To the north lies the
Grand Chamber of Meditation, where all shou-lin come to relax.  To the south is
Kaij's chambers, where new shou-lin are given their basic clothing.    
