#38204
The Hall of Balance~
   The hall of balance is not named as is just because it is what many a
shou-lin strives for.  When this temple was built, it was strategically placed
in between the two wings of the Orders of the Lotus and Mortis, much like the
focus on which a balance is built.  To the north lies the training chambers.  
To the south is the storage chamber.    
~
