#38205
The Test of Balance~
   Only one shou-lin of the guild, be they from the Order of the Lotus, the
Order of Mortis, or the middle path, may hold the title 'Grandmaster of
Balance' This being is one who has attained a harmony of defense and offense,
aggression and pacifism in combat.  This simple room you stand in now is the
challenge chamber, where shou lin are organized to fight and perhaps become the
new Grandmaster of Balance
~
