#38208
The Grand Chamber of Meditation~
   You step into an enormous chamber with high celings.  This large room has
absolutely no furniture, only row upon row of straw mats.  The walls are
decoratively adorned with paintings of many things the shou lin represent in
their teachings, the Wind, the Snake, the Crane, the Tiger, and the Dragon.  
All members of all orders periodically come here to meditate and study.    
~
