#38209
The Art of the Shou-Lin~
   This room houses all the apparatus needed for a shou-lin to train their body
and mind into a fighting machine.  Much like a gym, minor grandmasters grapple
with new students as well as teach them how to strike and defend.  Small groups
of students sit with heads bowed, learning to slow their breathing and heart
rates.  If you wish to learn the arts of the guild, then you have come to the
right place.    
~
