#38210
The Stance of the Crab~
One sphere or stance of combat used is that of the crab. Crouching in a low
position, the shou lin is able to deflect attacks and shield their own bodies whilst
still remaining fairly mobile. This defensive strategy allows the shou-lin to
save them from massive amounts of physical damage, giving them more time
to escape if need be.
~
