#38211
The Stance of the Cobra~
   Some say that the most important thing of combat is initiative.  Coiling
their bodies into a defensive position, the Shou Lin is able to surprise an
attacker with a explosive quick strike.  An excellent maneuver for a wounded
shou-lin that is being chased or hunted, this maneuver may save or end their
life.    
~
