#38212
Stance of the Mantis~
   Adopting the aggressive style of the preying mantis allows the shou lin to
do more damage to an opponent by sacrificing defensive positions.  In this
stance, the shou-lin is more opt to utilize the dealy arts of the Crane, Tiger,
and Dragon.  The Order of Mortis favors this stance, much as the Order of the
Lotus favors the Crab.    
~
