#38213
The north wing~
   The order of the lotus have a respect for life and the balance that it must
be kept in tune with.  This chamber is an example of that, as it contains a
mini-ecosystem where plants and animals live in balance with the shou-lin.  It
is this one thing: Balance, that the Lotus and Mortis share..  They simply seek
to maintain it through different means.    
~
