#38214
The Meditation Chambers~
   It is here that many Shou-lin come to meditate and free their spirit into
the world.  Before you, hundreds of them kneel on straw mats with eyes closed
in perfect concentration.  Some chant silent mantras to themselves, others sit
rigid and unmoving as stone, and a very few others levitate inches off the
floor.    
~
