#38216
Kaij's Room~
   Kaij is a relatively new shou-lin of the middle path and has devoted himself
to serving his guild by assisting those new to it.  His room is rather simple,
consisting of a cot, a floormat, a wash basin, and a number of chests which
hold robes and other such garb.  As you enter, he looks at you and reaches
within a chest behind him.    
~
