#38217
The Storage Chamber~
   While Shou-Lins do not believe in material gain and possessions, they have
built this storage chamber for those items they may have gathered from across
the realms.  Such items are for the guild to use to teach and learn, and are
left here with that purpose in mind.  It is the expectation of the Grandmasters
that an item freely taken will be reciprocated by an item freely given.    
~
