#38218
The south wing~
   In this room, practice and fighting dummies are strewn all over the place.
Wooden arms have been shattered, heads knocked off, legs broken.  Like the
Order of the Lotus, this order is too dedicated to preserving the balance.  
But they believe that order should be balanced by chaos, and light by
darkness...  This is the path they follow.    
~
