#38220
The Ashenhammer Forge~
   You have entered into a relatively small stone building.  A wooden,
makeshift counter has been setup in the rear of the building.  A large sign
hangs crooked from the wall behind the counter.  In the center of the building
is a large firepit, coals burning and popping rapidly.  On each side of the
fire pit two large iron anvils protrude from the ground, both pulsing with
magic.    
~
